1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,319
Raat ke do baj gaye... aur dimaag band hi nahi ho raha.

2
00:00:05,069 --> 00:00:08,150
Mahadev, agar sab galat ho gaya toh?

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,366
Aur agar sab theek ho gaya toh?

4
00:00:11,816 --> 00:00:15,130
Aap mazaak kar rahe ho... main sach mein pareshaan hoon.

5
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:18,791
Nadi har mod ki chinta nahi karti... bas behti hai.

6
00:00:19,241 --> 00:00:22,093
Toh main bas agla ek kadam dekhun?

7
00:00:22,313 --> 00:00:25,232
Haan. Kal ki chinta aaj ki neend na chheene.

8
00:00:25,682 --> 00:00:28,477
Ek kadam... ek saans. Itna kaafi hai.
